    "三": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Three"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3つ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "三种清理互不影响：清除图片不会删除文字，清除介绍不会删除图片；收藏与固定日期始终保留。操作无法撤销，但之后可以重新联网获取。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The three cleanup operations are independent: clearing images won't delete text, and clearing stories won't delete images; favorites and pinned dates are always retained. Actions can't be undone, but you can retrieve them online again later."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3つの整理は互いに影響しません。画像を消去してもテキストは削除されず、ストーリーを消去しても画像は削除されません。お気に入りと固定日付は常に保持されます。操作は元に戻せませんが、後で再びオンラインで取得できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一年": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
