          }
        }
      }
    },
    "介绍缺失不会影响图片浏览；Daybreak 不会用其他日期或地区的文本补齐。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A missing story won't affect image browsing; Daybreak won't fill it in with text from other dates or regions."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "紹介が欠けていても画像の閲覧には影響しません。Daybreak は他の日付や地域のテキストで補完しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "介绍获取失败，可稍后刷新重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Failed to get the story; you can refresh and try again later."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "紹介の取得に失敗しました。後で更新して再試行できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "介绍语言与所选地区不一致，因此没有显示。": {
