    "当前仅缓存了预览图；预览或分享时会先尝试获取原图，失败时只能使用预览分辨率。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only preview images are cached currently; when previewing or sharing, the app first tries to fetch the original image, and if that fails, only the preview resolution is available."
          }
