    "按 ID 获取 Daybreak 壁纸": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get Daybreak Wallpaper by ID"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ID で Daybreak 壁紙を取得"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按 ID 获取壁纸": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get a wallpaper by ID"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ID で壁紙を取得"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按图片收藏，同一张图片跨日期或跨地区只计一次。没有本地出现记录的收藏仍会保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Favorites are counted by image; the same image is counted only once across dates or regions. Favorites without a local appearance record are still kept."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "お気に入りは画像ごとに集計され、同じ画像は日付や地域をまたいでも 1 回だけ数えられます。ローカルの出現記録がないお気に入りも保持されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按地区与来源日期回看时光": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Look back at the Timeline by region and source date"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地域とソースの日付でタイムラインを振り返る"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按来源日期和地区返回 Daybreak 已缓存的壁纸；日期按你选择的日历日期解释，不会静默换图。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Returns the cached Daybreak wallpaper for a source date and market. The date is the calendar date you picked; the intent never silently switches images."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ソースの日付と地域に対応する、Daybreak にキャッシュ済みの壁紙を返します。日付は選択したカレンダー上の日付として扱われ、別の画像に黙って切り替わることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按每张图片最早的本地记录月份整理，不代表点按收藏的时间。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organized by the month of each image's earliest local record; this does not reflect when you tapped to favorite it."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各画像の最も早いローカル記録の月ごとに整理されます。お気に入りにした時刻を示すものではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
