            "value": "高解像度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认跟随系统地区与首选语言。只有手动选择地区后才会保存该选择；系统设置改变后，重新打开 Daybreak 即可重新解析。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By default, the system region and preferred language are followed. A region is saved only after you select it manually; if system settings change, reopen Daybreak to resolve again."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "デフォルトではシステムの地域と優先言語に従います。地域は手動で選択した場合にのみ保存されます。システム設定を変更した後は、Daybreak を開き直すと再解析されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "，尚未到来": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", not yet arrived"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "、まだ到来していません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "，没有本地记录": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", no local record"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "、ローカル記録なし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "，记录 %lld 天，收藏 %lld 张": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
